composer-generators Release Notes
=================================

# Version 0.1.2 - 2025-02-04

* provide bundled library without version
  when version is not valid

# Version 0.1.1 - 2024-12-30

* remove 'v' in version number

# Version 0.1.0 - 2024-10-11

* find main project name and provide it
  Ex: Provides: php-composer(vendor/project) = 1.0.0

* find bundled lilbraries and provide them
  Ex: Provides: bundled(php-composer(vendor/lib)) = 1.2.3

